Copyright the Enginehost contributors. Licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 (LICENSE).

The runtime is new Java written for Enginehost. Two projects informed it:

- xmoezzz/CMVS-Engine (MIT): the PS2 and PS3 text-dumper format information; no source is included.
- morkt/GARbro (MIT): CmvsArchive.java, CmvsMd5.java and CmvsScheme.java are a Java port of GARbro's
  ArcFormats/Cmvs sources and of the encryption scheme it records. GARbro's licence, which requires its
  notice to travel with the port, is in LICENSE.GARbro. MIT allows the combined work to be GPL-3.0.
